  "body": "# gh-sdp 2.4.0\n\nDistributes the exact signed SDPTool2.4.0 engine. Standard SDUI0.3 prototype launch now uses DocumentHost with explicit --context choice and SVG fixture data and guarded reload. Legacy0.2 without context remains supported. Headless checks distinguish semantic preflight from native layout; callbacks remain unbound.\n\nUpgrade with `gh extension upgrade sdp`. Existing setup registration follows the new executable. Project Framework upgrades remain separate explicit preview/apply operations. Linux amd64 is qualified; no XFMD context-selection UI is included.\n\nSee [canonical release](https://github.com/Hans-Einar/SDP/releases/tag/v2.4.0) and [context documentation](https://github.com/Hans-Einar/SDP/blob/v2.4.0/SDUI/docs/prototype-context.md).\n"
